	(text "Config Resistors \nR39 (MD56) - 50 MHz MCLK default (on)\nR40 (MD57) - 7/6 Etended RAS timing (np)\nR41 (MD58) - multiple CAS DRAMs (on)\nR42 (MD51) - port 3C3/46E8h Sleep address (np)\n\nDefault - R39 and R41 installed. R40 must be installled for slow DRAM."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
